sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant User as User (Editor)
participant SPA as WP Admin SPA
participant Det as DetectionProvider (FE)
participant WP as WP REST (/recognition/identify)
participant Rec as Recognition Service
participant DB as WP DB

User->>SPA: Open Workbench (People view)
SPA->>Det: Lazy-load model + detect faces on thumbnails
Det-->>SPA: Face boxes (bboxes per image)

SPA->>WP: POST identify {attachmentId, faces[bbox...]}

WP->>WP: Crop faces server-side
WP->>Rec: /embeddings/batch (face crops)
Rec-->>WP: embeddings[]
WP->>Rec: /suggest (topK, threshold)
Rec-->>WP: suggestions[][] (rosterId, score)
WP->>Rec: /cluster-unknowns (low-confidence)
Rec-->>WP: clusterIds[]
WP-->>SPA: faces[{faceId, clusterId?, suggestions[]}]

SPA->>User: Show chips + Drawer stacks (clustered unknowns, suggestions)

User->>SPA: Label one face ("Ana") / bulk confirm a stack
SPA->>WP: identify {faces[label: rosterId|newName]}
WP->>DB: Persist FaceObservation(+label_status)
WP-->>SPA: Ack + refreshed suggestions (optional)